    InitializeParams returns the InitializeParams provided during the client's
    initial connection.

func (ss *ServerSession) ListRoots(ctx context.Context, params *ListRootsParams) (*ListRootsResult, error)
    ListRoots lists the client roots.

func (ss *ServerSession) Log(ctx context.Context, params *LoggingMessageParams) error
    Log sends a log message to the client. The message is not sent if the client
    has not called SetLevel, or if its level is below that of the last SetLevel.

func (ss *ServerSession) NotifyProgress(ctx context.Context, params *ProgressNotificationParams) error
    NotifyProgress sends a progress notification from the server to the client
    associated with this session. This is typically used to report on the status
    of a long-running request that was initiated by the client.

func (ss *ServerSession) Ping(ctx context.Context, params *PingParams) error
    Ping pings the client.

func (ss *ServerSession) Wait() error
    Wait waits for the connection to be closed by the client.

