			Name:    "hello-server",
			Version: "1.0.0",
		},
		nil,
	)

	mcp.AddTool(s, &mcp.Tool{
		Name:        "hello_world",
		Description: "Returns Hello, MCP World!",
	}, hello.HelloHandler)

	return s
}
