	// [Server.AddPrompt]), with default value `{"listChanged":true}`. Similarly,
	// if the [ClientOptions.SubscribeHandler] or
	// [ClientOptions.CompletionHandler] are set, the inferred capabilities are
	// adjusted accordingly.
